Package: secretctl
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libsecret-1-0, libsecret-tools, dbus-user-session
Maintainer: secretctl contributors
Description: Local credential isolation broker for agent authentication
 Linux support is restricted to low and medium risk actions. An unlocked
 Secret Service session is required; plaintext fallback is never used.
